      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/09-characoids-tetra-relationship/salminus_arrived__en/",
      "html": "<p>Old fish get a breathtakingly beautiful golden colour all over the body. This species is also known under the old, invalid name S. maxillosus.</p>"
